    "Add `embedded` to show an open wizard in a page as a specimen, the way a catalogue or a showcase does: it keeps its look, its dialog role and its labelling, but it is not modal. It does not take focus, trap Tab, set `aria-modal`, or close on Escape or native back, and it renders in place in the page's flow instead of presenting into an `OverlayProvider`.",
